{"unit_id":"a1113622001__dsh-session-stats-panel#feature-1","repo":"a1113622001/dsh-session-stats-panel","commit":"d5b34f36fbecc2438db2b6006bdbc4a990cf6ffb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-stats-panel 的功能「会话用量面板」：在 Web 页面右侧展示缓存命中率、累计 Tokens、运行时间和模型请求数。面板从当前会话统计投影读取数据，并可收起。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:201-245"]}
{"unit_id":"a1113622001__dsh-session-stats-panel#feature-2","repo":"a1113622001/dsh-session-stats-panel","commit":"d5b34f36fbecc2438db2b6006bdbc4a990cf6ffb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-stats-panel 的功能「费用估算」：依据当前模型和会话 token 分项，使用 DeepSeek 峰谷价格估算人民币费用；非 DeepSeek 模型不计价。价格按查看时刻选择。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:42-90","lib/client.js:208-210"]}
{"unit_id":"a1113622001__dsh-session-stats-panel#feature-3","repo":"a1113622001/dsh-session-stats-panel","commit":"d5b34f36fbecc2438db2b6006bdbc4a990cf6ffb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-stats-panel 的功能「账户余额」：页面加载后向插件服务端路由请求余额，并每两分钟刷新。服务端从 credentials 或环境变量读取 DeepSeek 密钥，再调用余额接口。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:184-200","lib/index.js:39-55"]}
{"unit_id":"a1113622001__dsh-session-stats-panel#feature-4","repo":"a1113622001/dsh-session-stats-panel","commit":"d5b34f36fbecc2438db2b6006bdbc4a990cf6ffb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-stats-panel 的功能「会话模型显示」：面板通过 sessions.models 查询当前会话的模型，并在标题区域显示模型名称；切换会话时重新读取，调用失败则清空模型信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:166-183","lib/client.js:237-244"]}
{"unit_id":"a1113622001__dsh-session-stats-panel#caveat-1","repo":"a1113622001/dsh-session-stats-panel","commit":"d5b34f36fbecc2438db2b6006bdbc4a990cf6ffb","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-stats-panel 使用前须知：账户余额功能需要服务端可解析的 DEEPSEEK_API_KEY，并会向 api.deepseek.com 请求余额；密钥保留在服务端，浏览器只请求插件路由。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:39-55"]}
